## Flags for the installed binary's VM (ADR-0036). Burrito's launcher already passes
## -noshell; these are what `Geex.run/1`'s `--erl` flags add under `mix run`.

## Keep the Erlang shell's input driver off stdin, so `:prim_tty` owns the terminal.
-noinput

## Disable the break handler, so a SIGINT from outside ends the VM instead of opening the
## BEAM's BREAK menu on the terminal. Ctrl-C itself sends no SIGINT: `Geex.TerminalIO` turns
## the tty's signal keys off, so it reaches the keymap as a key (BUG-3).
+Bd
